<title>GERMANY: Daimler - board meeting to decide structure.</title>
<headline>Daimler - board meeting to decide structure.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Daimler-Benz AG on Saturday said a decision on its future group structure would be taken by its supervisory board on January 23.</p>
<p>A spokesman declined further direct comment on information obtained from sources that the board would approve a proposal to merge Daimler with its car unit Mercedes-Benz AG, effective January 1 1997.</p>
<p>The Spiegel magazine also carried a report in this week's issue, saying the merger had been agreed.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
